#ROOM
Vnum     51223
Name     Veyran Final Navigation Challenge~
Sector   city~
Flags    indoors safe~
Desc     You are almost finished. The graduation hall is immediately north, but the
door is locked. The child here appears upset and may know how to open it.
Finding and returning the child's lost toy should help.

Hints: find the lost toy give the toy to the child ask about the key

The final challenge takes place beneath displays of Veyran engineering
diagrams, prototype housings and celebrated technical breakthroughs.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    51224
Key       51323
Flags     isdoor closed locked~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    51222
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 51243 1 51223
Reset D 0 51223 0 2
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51224
Name     Veyran Graduation Gallery~
Sector   city~
Desc     You completed the academy course. Proceed through the graduation gallery,
receive your diploma and continue toward the docking bay.

The gallery is a transparent orbital walkway attached to Veyran Technical
Academy. Instead of a city beneath you, the windows reveal TRAPPIST-1 e below,
with neighbouring worlds occasionally visible against the dark. Structural
ribs frame the corridor while traffic lights from local shuttles move silently
beyond the glass.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    51223
Flags     isdoor~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    51225
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 51250 1 51224
Reset O 0 51314 1 51224
Reset D 0 51224 2 0
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51225
Name     TRAPPIST-1 e Orbital Dock~
Sector   city~
Desc     This docking bay projects from the academy station so that training shuttles
can approach without crossing the inhabited modules. Guidance lights, docking
clamps and service equipment line the perimeter.

Beyond the bay you can see TRAPPIST-1 e below, with neighbouring worlds
occasionally visible against the dark. A small shuttle is waiting to carry
graduates down toward TRAPPIST-1 e. To board it, use ENTER.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    51224
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction somewhere~
ToRoom    51226
Flags     hidden can_enter~
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 51222 1 51225
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51226
Name     TRAPPIST-1 e Planetfall Shuttle~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~
Desc     You are inside a compact planetfall shuttle. Passenger seats sit directly
behind the pilot position, with a small service compartment at the rear. The
craft carries newly graduated students from Veyran Technical Academy toward
TRAPPIST-1 e.

Give your diploma to the pilot when requested. If you do not yet have one, use
LEAVE and return to the graduation area.
~
#EXIT
Direction somewhere~
ToRoom    51225
Flags     hidden can_leave~
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 51255 1 51226
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51227
Name     Veyran Continuity Briefing~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors prototype~
Desc     The final briefing concerns character continuity and recovery after death. In
this setting death can carry severe consequences, so make use of whatever
medical, backup or continuity services the wider game provides. Update those
safeguards regularly rather than waiting until after a major loss.

The briefing chamber uses layered diagnostic consoles, removable panels and
accessible service conduits, while a status display shows the orbital position
of Veyran Technical Academy above TRAPPIST-1 e.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    51222
Flags     isdoor closed~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    51217
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 51295 1 51227
Reset D 0 51227 0 1
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51299
Name     Veyran Academy Program Service Room~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~Desc     This sealed service room exists for academy mobile programs and should not be
removed. Maintenance labels identify it as part of Veyran Technical Academy's
internal automation network.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51300
Name     Veyran Academy Test Workshop~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob factory~Desc     A small test workshop used by academy staff. Benches, diagnostic ports and
layered diagnostic consoles, removable panels and accessible service conduits
fill the room.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51301
Name     Veyran Quiet Test Compartment~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob safe silence~Desc     A deliberately quiet compartment isolated from the busier academy modules.
bright task lighting surrounded by dense fields of status indicators and
sound-damped surfaces make it suitable for testing or study.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51329
Name     Veyran Isolated Test Chamber~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob prototype~Desc     This isolated test chamber is intentionally featureless. Instrument panels
from layered diagnostic consoles, removable panels and accessible service
conduits are the only obvious connection to the rest of Veyran Technical
Academy.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51330
Name     Veyran Student Commons~
Sector   inside~
Flags    nomob safe~
Desc     This is the academy student commons, a final safe place to rest, read and
practice using the message system. Use NOTE LIST to list messages, NOTE READ
<msgnum> to read one, and HELP NOTE for additional commands.

The room is a compact workshop-commons where tables double as repair benches
and study stations. The station windows give occasional views of TRAPPIST-1 e
below, with neighbouring worlds occasionally visible against the dark.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    51200
